This file is a Thai wordlist used, per AD-25 and AD-26, to compile the
BytesTrie dictionary embedded in folio-go/internal/text (Story 2.1: the
Thai break-opportunity spike). It is redistributed unmodified from its
upstream source.

Measured at the revision fetched for this story: 62,107 lines, 62,106
DISTINCT words (one duplicate line, "โรม่า") — the distinct-word count
matches the 62,106 figure carried in the epic's acceptance criteria
exactly (see the Story 2.1 spike report).
